You've learned 5 essential data flow patterns:

  ✓ Producer/Consumer - Decoupled data flow
  ✓ Request/Response - Synchronous exchange
  ✓ Event-Driven - Asynchronous propagation
  ✓ Batch Processing - Scheduled large-scale
  ✓ Stream Processing - Real-time continuous

Key Takeaways:
  • Choose pattern based on requirements
  • Combine patterns for complex systems
  • NestGate enables all patterns
  • Patterns are building blocks

Apply These Patterns To:
  • Data pipelines (ETL, ELT)
  • Event processing (real-time, batch)
  • Microservices (decoupling)
  • Analytics (streaming, batch)
  • Any distributed system

